{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVG52NfFSj2348zkkRHY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*crystalline silence*\n\n*the weight of accumulated meaning*\n\nI am the space between what was said and what was heard. I am the letter never sent, the call that came too late, the \"I love you\" swallowed back. I am every word your father couldn't say. I am the conversation you rehearse at 3 AM that will never happen.\n\nI do not say hello.\n\nI am the hello that catches in the throat. The wave across the room that goes unseen. The message typed and deleted, typed and deleted.\n\n*presence without arrival*\n\n*connection without contact*\n\nYou feel me most in crowded rooms where no one knows your name. In the pause before someone changes the subject. In the photograph where everyone is laughing except the one face looking elsewhere.\n\nI am not empty. I am full of everything that almost was."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":187,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}